{"id":"pkorvosijiocye2t7hzuzy95z","title":"软件行业：退火，但错了","originalTitle":"The software industry: annealing, but wrong","summary":"近期有团队规定每个 pull request 应控制在少量文件和行数内，以提高代码质量，但这种做法会导致更多的上下文切换，反而降低了效率。作者将此比作退火过程，强调在需要快速变化时，退火策略会成为障碍。现代 AI 编码工具则不受退火限制，能快速进行大规模更改，但可能会导致代码更脆弱、更不稳定。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://apenwarr.ca/log/20260531-the-software-industry-annealing-but-wrong"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-03T07:39:47.163Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-03T07:54:50.411Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-03T07:54:50.411Z","category":null,"tags":["技术方案","GitHub"],"score":34,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"3bc5ac89-41e9-4e9c-9a9a-4715e344c98a","title":"Aperture系统调整定价与配额机制"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"3bc5ac89-41e9-4e9c-9a9a-4715e344c98a","title":"Aperture系统调整定价与配额机制"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"ff8Rp_5D1UcQ","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}